      "text": "Freight term of the day: free time.\n\nThe days you can use or hold a container before demurrage or detention starts. Terminal and carrier free time run on separate clocks.\n\nIt's often negotiable at booking, and asking then is far cheaper than paying later. https://t.co/YvYtCuPBRp",
