      "text": "📦 ERADICATING INTERMODAL FREIGHT FRICTION: AUTOMATING PORT DETENTION RECONCILIATIONS\n\nGlobal container shipping networks frequently face costly intermodal logistics gridlock, where cargo containers become backlogged at international marine terminals, leading to billions of https://t.co/Xv7mDwuFqV",
