      },
      "text": "Freight term of the day: demurrage.\n\nThe charge for leaving a full container inside the terminal after its free time runs out. It rises in tiers, so two weeks costs far more than twice one week.\n\nNot the same as detention. That one's tomorrow. https://t.co/SPrgVO9q06",
      "url": "https://x.com/cargolinked_com/status/2109569769674280962"
    },
