      "text": "DELAYS DON'T JUST COST TIME. THEY CAN COST MONEY.\n\nIn international shipping, a container's cost doesn't always stop at ocean freight.\n\nWhen containers exceed their agreed free time, demurrage and detention charges may apply—adding avoidable pressure to your logistics budget. https://t.co/MMuiqLbEFz",
