      "text": "⚓ DOCKING WITH PRECISION: WINKLINK'S PORT TELEMETRY ARBITRATING AUTOMATED CONTAINER DEMURRAGE ESCROWS\n\nIn the global container shipping sector, vessel turnaround time at deepwater container terminals dictates maritime logistics margins. Demurrage and detention fees—penalties https://t.co/4TFCNvBHOE",
