        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 1,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "Detention and demurrage are not the same charge, though they get used interchangeably. Demurrage: a container sits inside the terminal past free time. Detention: a container or chassis is held outside the terminal past free time. Different clocks, often different bills. (1/3)",
      "url": "https://x.com/CandCWarehouse/status/2114532022844850568"
    },
