        "like_count": 2,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "reply_count": 0,
        "retweet_count": 0
      },
      "text": "🚢 Demurrage vs. Detention\n\n📍 Demurrage: Container stays inside the terminal beyond free time.\n\n🚛 Detention: Container stays outside the terminal beyond free time.\n\nEasy rule:\nInside = Demurrage\nOutside = Detention\n\nKnow the difference. Avoid unnecessary costs. 💰 https://t.co/DUbYJlWUEG",
      "url": "https://x.com/niryatsetu1/status/2105581948458745922"
    },
    {
      "author_id": "1966113315752386560",
      "created_at": "2026-10-05T21:32:22.000Z",
      "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
        "2107222387741671835"
