      "text": "A shipping invoice can be calculated correctly-and still deserve a closer look.\n\nDemurrage. Detention. Storage.\n\nI'm building FreightAuditly to compare charges with free-time terms and shipment evidence.\n\nHow do you check them today: Excel, manual review, or software?\n\n#Logistics",
